abstract: >
  This repository accompanies the research manuscript
  "Barren Plateau Mitigation in Quantum Neural Networks:
  An Empirical and Artifact-Level Comparison of Layerwise
  Training and Local Cost Functions." It provides the
  manuscript, source code, experimental configurations,
  figures, and reproducibility resources for evaluating
  layerwise training and local cost function strategies
  for mitigating barren plateaus in Quantum Neural Networks
  using TensorFlow Quantum.

keywords:
  - Quantum Neural Networks
  - Quantum Machine Learning
  - Barren Plateaus
  - Variational Quantum Circuits
  - TensorFlow Quantum
  - Layerwise Training
  - Local Cost Functions
  - Empirical Benchmarking

